{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["犹大的灾难"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说：“就算摩西和撒母耳站在我面前求情，我也不会怜悯这些百姓。你把他们从我面前赶走，让他们离开吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["如果他们问你，‘我们该去哪里，’你就告诉他们，耶和华这样说，",{"text":"“‘该死的死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"该被杀的被杀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"该遭饥荒的遭饥荒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"该被掳的被掳。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["“我要让他们遭受四种祸患——刀杀、狗撕、鸟啄、兽吞。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为希西迦的儿子犹大王玛拿西在耶路撒冷的所作所为，我要使他们的遭遇令天下万国惊惧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“耶路撒冷啊，谁会同情你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁会为你悲哀？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁会驻足向你问安？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你弃绝我，背离我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我要伸手攻击你，毁灭你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已厌倦施怜悯。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在这片土地上的各城门口用簸箕簸散我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们丧掉儿女；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要灭绝他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不思悔改。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他们的寡妇比海沙还多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使毁灭者在午间攻击青年的母亲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让她们突然陷入痛苦和惊恐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生过七个孩子的母亲心力枯竭，奄奄一息。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的太阳在白昼已经坠落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必蒙羞受辱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使其余的人丧身在敌人刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米诉苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["母亲啊，我真不幸，因为你生了我这个跟全犹大争论、激辩的人。我没有向人借贷，也没有借贷给人，然而人人都咒骂我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华说：“我必拯救你，使你受益。我必使仇敌在灾祸、困难来临时哀求你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["谁能折断来自北方之敌的铁拳铜臂呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为你们境内罪恶泛滥，我要使敌人任意抢掠你们的财宝，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["把你们掳到陌生的地方。我的怒火已被点燃，要烧灭你们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，你知道我的遭遇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顾念我，眷顾我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报应迫害我的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要取走我的性命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你不轻易发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你知道我为了你忍受辱骂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之上帝耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我得到你的话便吃了下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的话是我心中的快乐和喜悦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我属于你的名下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有与作乐的人为伍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有与他们同乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我独坐一处，因为你的手按在我身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我义愤填膺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我的痛楚无休无止？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我的创伤无法治愈？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你要像一条时断时流的小溪一样靠不住吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"因此，耶和华对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“如果你回心转意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就让你重新事奉我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若说有益的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不说无益的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就可以做我的发言人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓便会归向你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你不可归向他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你在这些百姓面前成为坚固的铜墙。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要攻击你，却不能胜过你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我与你同在，我会搭救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把你从恶人手中救出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从残暴之徒的权势下赎回。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}